### Walking directions – Tahrir Sq. → Egyptian Museum
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/route
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locations": [
    { "lat": 30.0082, "lon": 31.5074 },
    { "lat": 30.0479, "lon": 31.2355 }
  ],
  "costing": "pedestrian",
  "directions_options": { "units": "kilometers" }
