###

### Truck directions – Tahrir → Alexandria, avoid tolls
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/route
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locations": [
    { "lat": 30.0444, "lon": 31.2357 },
    { "lat": 31.2001, "lon": 29.9187 }
  ],
  "costing": "truck",
  "costing_options": {
    "truck": { "use_tolls": 0.0 }
  },
  "directions_options": { "units": "kilometers" }
}

###

### Isochrone – reachability polygons from Tahrir Sq. at 10 / 20 / 30 minutes
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/isochrone
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locations": [
    { "lat": 30.0444, "lon": 31.2357 }
  ],
  "costing": "auto",
  "contours": [
    { "time": 10, "color": "ff0000" },
    { "time": 20, "color": "00ff00" },
    { "time": 30, "color": "0000ff" }
  ],
  "polygons": true
}

###

### Locate – snap coordinates onto the routing graph (debug nearest edges/nodes)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/locate
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locations": [
    { "lat": 30.0444, "lon": 31.2357 }
  ],
  "costing": "auto",
  "verbose": true
}

###

### Baseline route (no live traffic) – Tahrir → Giza. Note summary.time.
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/route
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locations": [
    { "lat": 30.0444, "lon": 31.2357 },
    { "lat": 29.9792, "lon": 31.1342 }
  ],
  "costing": "auto",
  "directions_options": { "units": "kilometers" }
}

###

### Live-traffic route – same Tahrir → Giza, opted into current traffic speeds.
### After posting slow /traffic/probes above, summary.time should rise vs. baseline.
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/route
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locations": [
    { "lat": 30.0444, "lon": 31.2357 },
    { "lat": 29.9792, "lon": 31.1342 }
  ],
  "costing": "auto",
  "costing_options": {
    "auto": { "speed_types": ["freeflow", "constrained", "predicted", "current"] }
  },
  "date_time": { "type": 0 },
  "directions_options": { "units": "kilometers" }
}

